ex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">Music stream authorization</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">November 21, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Ported Cherri's signed stream-ticket flow.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fetch and cache short-lived music playback tickets through /api/music/ticket, then attach them to provider stream requests.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed YouTube Music and SoundCloud playback requests missing the required stream ticket.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">Music API providers</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">November 21, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Connected Vaulted Music to Cherri-compatible API services.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added Worker and Pages API pass-through routing for all /api/* endpoints, including every music provider.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added same-origin API routing and fallback between available API hosts so music search, streams, artwork, browse, and provider selection work on Vaulted deployments.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">Music and playback controls</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">November 21, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Added Vaulted Music and quick playback controls in the address bar.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a Music tab with browsing, search, library, playlists, and playback controls.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a compact now-playing address-bar player with track details and previous, play/pause, and next controls.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Connected the address-bar controls to the active music queue.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">Game catalog and backgrounds</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">November 20, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Improved game discovery and refreshed the homepage presentation.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a compact game details side panel that shifts the catalog aside when open.</span><