hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">On content tabs, the navigation dock now tucks to a small hover handle and smoothly returns when hovered or keyboard-focused; it stays accessible on touch devices.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">v1.1.2</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">October 29, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">A refreshed public profile experience.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Redesigned public profile cards with a dark starfield banner, prominent avatar, separate cosmetic tags and role badges, and the bio and member-since date together on the card.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Removed Add Friend and Block actions from public profile pages.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">v1.1.1</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">October 29, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Shop, profiles, navigation, and search polish.</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Restored the cosmetic shop with credits, purchases, gifts, profile borders, effects, username styles, and purchasable tags.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added daily visit, search, and game/app launch credit rewards with clear progress and limits.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added an owned cosmetics collection to Profile with previews and Equip/Unequip controls; public profiles show credits, total cosmetics purchased, and bios on the profile card.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Members cards now show equipped profile decorations, effects, username styles, and cosmetic tags.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Refined Home favorite shortcuts and their refresh behavior.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Reworked navigation into a floating dock with a divider after the Vaulted mark, a Cloaks destination, pointer-following warp, and a wider glass finish.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a theme-aware animated electric current to the home search bar, including pointer surges and click pulses.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Applied a frosted GlassSurface-inspired finish to the navigation dock and home search.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed duplicate role badge icons and restored clear role names on hover.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed profile and member-list crashes while loading cosmetics.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed stale or malformed asset integrity hashes that left the site stuck on its loading screen.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-wrench" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.106-3.105c.32-.322.863-.22.983.218a6 6 0 0 1-8.259 7.057l-7.91 7.91a1 1 0 0 1-2.999-3l7.91-7.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.057-8.259c.438.12.54.662.219.984z"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Kept navbar width fixed during hover after widening it horizontally.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Removed Notes and Tools from the primary navigation.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-rose-500/10 text-rose-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-minus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Removed proximity-based navigation scaling so the bar keeps a steady size.</span></li></ul></div></article><article class="relative grid grid-cols-[20px_1fr] gap-x-5"><div class="relative flex flex-col items-center"><div class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-xl mt-2 z-10 bg-(--bg-3) border border-(--border-2)"></div><div class="w-px flex-1 bg-(--border-4) mt-1"></div></div><div class="pb-12 "><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1 flex-wrap"><h2 class="text-base font-semibold text-(--bright-text) font-mono tracking-tight">v1.1.0</h2><span class="text-(--border-2)">Â·</span><span class="text-xs text-(--text-muted)">October 19, 2026</span></div><p class="text-sm text-(--text) leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-prose">Vaulted Official Release</p><ul class="flex flex-col gap-2.5"><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a tab preview and confirmation step when choosing a cloak.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added the Sky theme with a soft blue primary color and reordered sidebar navigation.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Hidden the address toolbar and tab strip on Home for a cleaner layout; both return on other pages.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed HTML downloads through the proxy and placed a styled Download button beside Favorites on game cards.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added HTML downloads to game and app cards, improved search relevance and abbreviation matching, and simplified launcher links to a single game URL.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Snapchat links now use a consistent Windows and Chrome browser identity without changing other sites.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed proxy connection defaults and saved server settings; connection failures now stop with an actionable message instead of retrying indefinitely.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added Heaven: a dark celestial theme with midnight surfaces, silver-blue moonlight, visible layered sunbeams from above, a warm halo, lavender and champagne glows, and matching theme previews.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Rebranded Berri as vaulted, added the vault mark and fake vaulted:// URLs, and redesigned the home page with centered layout, clock, status details, and theme-aware dotted background.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Embedded Forge AI at vaulted://assistant.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a dedicated Apps sidebar page with 32 proxied web apps and official brand marks.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added Vaulted Notes with rich-text styles, lists, checklists, tables, search, pinned notes, and private per-account autosave.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added a Tools sidebar page with a calculator, timer, stopwatch, unit converter, password generator, percentage calculator, JSON formatter, and text counter.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Added Cloudflare Workers static-asset deployment support and a stable latest build flow.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Improved game browsing with alphabetical sorting and Favorites/Recent filtering; added loading progress and animated card reveals.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Set Incognito as the default theme and added six dark themes: Rosewood, Incognito, Oceanic, Amethyst Night, Cobalt, and Amber Night.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Fixed the Make it yours theme picker so its selection applies immediately; the none cloak keeps the lowercase vaulted tab title.</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm"><span class="shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5 bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-400"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="11" height="11" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-plus" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></span><span class="text-(--text) leading-relaxed">Required sign-in for Games, Apps, Forge AI, Notes, Tools, emulator pages, and game/app launches; unauthenticated visitors are sent to vaulted://login and returned afterward.</span></li